# Copy to web/.env for a local build against another API. Vite reads it at
# build time (on Render: set VITE_API_URL in the Static Site environment).
#
# VITE_API_URL is the API origin, for example https://<api>.onrender.com: no
# path, no trailing slash. Leave it empty locally: the calls stay relative and
# go through the Vite dev proxy. Changing it needs a rebuild of the web.
VITE_API_URL=
